{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Super Flashlight 是一款將 iPhone 變成多功能光源的實用工具，適合日常照明、派對娛樂與緊急求救場合。原價 US $1.99，現正限時免費，讓用家體驗 8 種燈光模式與太空主題介面。</p>\n\n<h2>燈光功能與模式</h2>\n<p>Super Flashlight 提供 8 種燈光模式，包括即時明亮的 LED 手電筒、可變色螢幕燈、1-25Hz 頻閃、SOS 摩爾斯電碼求救訊號、6 種色彩效果、蠟燭模擬、紅藍警燈，以及隨音樂節拍同步的 Disco 派對燈光。太空主題介面配合無廣告、無多餘權限、即時啟動、省電與離線可用，是日常照明、緊急應變與娛樂場合都適用的工具。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-362-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-363-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-364-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-365-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-366-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-367-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Super Flashlight – 手電筒</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T17:14:37.767443+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}